        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ac6214ceee304e97ba149fb815bfa4af",
      "statement": "All three handlers (processChangePlan, processWithdrawal, cancelTransaction) share the best-effort confirmation pipeline — email via sendActionConfirmation, an audit patch via patchAuditEventData, and a trackFeatureAction analytics event — none of which may throw or roll back the action; each handler's outer catch calls trackFeatureAction('...', 'fail', deviceData) so a handler-level failure is still reported to GA4 even when the pipeline was never reached.",
