      "id": "claim_f8cf2b3bc02c4fe081f7cdea3484ff40",
      "statement": "The change-plan modal UI is driven by planChangeStatus from checkPlanChangeEligibility: openChangePlan shows the locked variant (disabled selector + next-eligible date) when planChangeStatus.locked is true, otherwise the selectable variant with the current % annotated as 'ปัจจุบัน / Current' and the effective-date banner.",
