      "id": "claim_2ab62f1b3a93418ba1c2e360f0a96b85",
      "statement": "The cancel modal (openCancelTx) shows a per-type reassurance list before confirmCancelTx calls cancelTransaction(txId, deviceInfo): Enroll -> 'return to Not Enrolled'; Change Plan -> 'previous % restored, no 6-month lock'; Withdraw -> 'count not incremented, membership restored'.",
